From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:34:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: apple,pmc: add apple,t8132-pmc

The M4 (T8132) has the same PMC voter interface as T8140, at
0x382800000: agent floor words 0x4000 apart in a "voters" window and the
per-agent state and per-rail enable words in a "rails" window at
0x3828aa000. The CLPC child already documents apple,t8132-clpc; add the
parent compatible so a T8132 PMC node validates.

Signed-off-by: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 32ed6961b3f7623b42654ea1d2be56f30ca53c19)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
index 2d7cd4a64d..cbe0bbec21 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
@@ -24,7 +24,9 @@ description: |
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-pmc
+    enum:
+      - apple,t8132-pmc
+      - apple,t8140-pmc
 
   reg:
     items:
